@startuml UC-12 驳回处方
actor 药师
boundary "审方接口" as ReviewController
control "审方服务" as ReviewAppService
control "处方状态机" as PrescriptionStateMachine
entity "处方仓储" as PrescriptionRepository
entity "流转记录仓储" as FlowRecordRepository
药师 -> ReviewController : 提交审核驳回（理由、版本号）
ReviewController -> ReviewAppService : 驳回处方(处方编号, 理由, 版本)
ReviewAppService -> ReviewAppService : 校验理由不少于十字
ReviewAppService -> PrescriptionRepository : 查询处方
ReviewAppService -> PrescriptionStateMachine : 执行驳回迁移
PrescriptionStateMachine --> ReviewAppService : 目标状态为已驳回
ReviewAppService -> PrescriptionRepository : 按版本更新并保存理由
ReviewAppService -> FlowRecordRepository : 追加驳回记录
ReviewAppService --> ReviewController : 返回结果或错误
@enduml
